{"id":12686,"date":"2022-12-19T19:44:58","date_gmt":"2022-12-19T19:44:58","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/?p=12686"},"modified":"2022-12-30T19:46:44","modified_gmt":"2022-12-30T19:46:44","slug":"should-you-use-a-360-video-photo-booth-or-a-social-photo-booth-for-your-wedding","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/atlanta-dj\/should-you-use-a-360-video-photo-booth-or-a-social-photo-booth-for-your-wedding\/","title":{"rendered":"Should you use a 360 video Photo Booth or a social Photo Booth for your wedding"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">What&#8217;s a wedding without some photos? You can get all of your friends and family together for one big photo, but if you want to impact your guests and have them talking about your event for years to come, you need something more than just the usual.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">And with the latest technology available today, that&#8217;s not a problem! There are two types of photo booths: traditional ones (or social) and 360-degree video photo booths. Both offer unique features that may make them better suited for certain situations. You could hire a company like JAMMIN&#8217;s Photo Booth to provide these services. Here&#8217;s what you need to know before deciding which is right for you.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><b>Get an immersive and interactive experience with a 360 photo booth.<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright size-medium wp-image-6081\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/1-HaleyKyleSanctuaryEstate052521-64-6158a7b3602dc-200x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/1-HaleyKyleSanctuaryEstate052521-64-6158a7b3602dc-200x300.jpg 200w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/1-HaleyKyleSanctuaryEstate052521-64-6158a7b3602dc-683x1024.jpg 683w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/1-HaleyKyleSanctuaryEstate052521-64-6158a7b3602dc-768x1152.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/1-HaleyKyleSanctuaryEstate052521-64-6158a7b3602dc-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/1-HaleyKyleSanctuaryEstate052521-64-6158a7b3602dc-1365x2048.jpg 1365w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/1-HaleyKyleSanctuaryEstate052521-64-6158a7b3602dc-scaled.jpg 1707w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" \/><\/b><\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">360 photo booth is a great way to capture the moment.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Have your guests take photos of each other, and then add them to the social media feed or print them out as keepsakes.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This is a great way to get an immersive and interactive experience with a 360 photo booth. The only thing to remember is that you need a high-quality camera for the best results. You can also add filters and other features to make the pictures stand out.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><b>Capture more moments and emotions with a social photo booth<\/b><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You can capture more moments and emotions with a social photo booth. With a traditional photo booth, you need to capture four or five people in front of the backdrop simultaneously, which can be difficult if many guests are present. This will result in fewer pictures taken during your wedding day because people take longer to get into position. They may want to take fewer photos since other professionals have already photographed them.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">With a social photo booth, more guests can participate at once. You don&#8217;t need everyone to stand straight (or look at the camera). Just gather around together for an instant party shot! This way, you&#8217;ll have more people laughing in each picture than ever! It also means that you get more smiles on your wedding day because everyone is having a good time!<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><b>Make your event different by using the newest technology.<\/b><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Having a photo booth at your wedding is an excellent way to capture the emotions and moments of your celebration. A 360 photo booth allows you to capture more moments and emotions.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A social photo booth allows you to share all of these photos on social media instantly, making it quick and easy for friends and family members who couldn&#8217;t attend the event in person to view all of the fun!<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><b>It would help if you considered using the latest technology to make your big day special.<\/b><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You should consider using the latest technology to make your big day special. With a 360 photo booth, you can capture more moments and emotions and create a lasting memory of your wedding day.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A social photo booth is another option that can be used at weddings and other events such as birthdays, bar mitzvahs, baby showers, or even corporate events. A social photo booth allows guests to upload photos from their phones or cameras into an album for everyone to see and enjoy! For more on this, visit our company at <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.myjammindjs.com\/photobooth\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">JAMMIN&#8217; Photo Booth.\u00a0<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We hope the information above has helped you decide if a 360 video booth is right for your wedding. Remember, it&#8217;s not just about choosing between two options &#8211; there are many more ways to get creative with capturing this special day! We are proud of our work and know that no matter what decision you make, our team at <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.myjammindjs.com\/photobooth\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">JAMMIN&#8217;s Photo Booth<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> would love nothing more than to be part of capturing those memories on your big day.<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>What&#8217;s a wedding without some photos? You can get all of your friends and family together for one big photo, but if you want to impact your guests and have them talking about your event for years to come, you need something more than just the usual. And with the latest technology available today, that&#8217;s&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[7,10,15,17,20,26],"tags":[27,43,46,47,49,51,58,177],"class_list":["post-12686","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-atlanta-dj","category-blog","category-dj-service","category-event-dj","category-news","category-wedding-djs","tag-1-colorado-wedding-dj","tag-affordable-dj-service","tag-atlanta-dj","tag-atlanta-dj-music","tag-atlanta-entertainment","tag-atlanta-metro","tag-award-winning-dj-service","tag-wedding-dj"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.7 (Yoast SEO v26.7) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Should you use a 360 video Photo Booth or a social Photo Booth for your wedding - JAMMIN&#039; DJs Georgia &amp; Tennessee<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/atlanta-dj\/should-you-use-a-360-video-photo-booth-or-a-social-photo-booth-for-your-wedding\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta proper